## https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot#keyboard-shortcuts
Flameshot: Set the Pencil as paint tool                                              | p
Flameshot: Set the Line as paint tool                                                | d
Flameshot: Set the Arrow as paint tool                                               | a
Flameshot: Set Selection as paint tool                                               | s
Flameshot: Set the Rectangle as paint tool                                           | r
Flameshot: Set the Circle as paint tool                                              | c
Flameshot: Set the Marker as paint tool                                              | m
Flameshot: Add text to your capture                                                  | t
Flameshot: Set Pixelate as the paint tool                                            | b
Flameshot: Move selection 1px                                                        | Lt/Dn/Up/Rt
Flameshot: Resize selection 1px                                                      | S-Lt/Dn/Up/Rt
Flameshot: Symmetrically resize selection 2px                                        | C-S-Lt/Dn/Up/Rt
Flameshot: Quit capture                                                              | Esc
Flameshot: Move the selection area                                                   | C-m
Flameshot: Copy to clipboard                                                         | C-c
Flameshot: Save selection as a file                                                  | C-s
Flameshot: Undo the last modification                                                | C-z
Flameshot: Redo the next modification                                                | C-S-z
Flameshot: Leave the capture screen                                                  | C-q
Flameshot: Choose an app to open the capture                                         | C-o
Flameshot: Commit text in text area                                                  | C-CR
Flameshot: Cancel current selection                                                  | C-Bksp
Flameshot: Upload the selection to Imgur                                             | CR
Flameshot: Toggle visibility of sidebar                                              | Spc
Flameshot: Starts the color picker                                                   | g
Flameshot: Show the color wheel                                                      | R_click
Flameshot: Change the tool's thickness                                               | MWtn
Flameshot: Capture Screen                                                            | PrtSc
Flameshot: Screenshot History                                                        | S-PrtSc
Flameshot: Take a screenshot                                                         | PrtSc
Flameshot: Wait for 3 seconds, then take a screenshot                                | C-PrtSc
Flameshot: Take a full-screen (all monitors) screenshot and save it                  | S-PrtSc
Flameshot: Take a full-screen (all monitors) screenshot and copy it to the clipboard | C-S-PrtSc
Flameshot: Pin image on the desktop (User)                                           | C-t